   123	*Bracken's press: the four rulings on the clause. Ask him nicely. — The code, all three volumes, the hall's copy, not the library's; the library's second volume is missing a gathering. — The certified Greyvane transcript, on my shelf in the common room, grey card, my initials on the spine. — Tea. — Tell her she won't see her bed.*
   124	
   125	The assistant was where Karis had said, at a table under the window in the lower reading room with the district digests stacked beside her. She read the slip once and gave it back to him, which he had not expected, and stood, and pushed in her chair.
