   143	Lira came a quarter of an hour behind him, still taped at one wrist, with the tape off the other trailing from her fist. "Rooke stopped the drill," she said, and sat. "He walked across the whole floor to my cross and said *Records hall. Now.* and gave my place to the Force." She took the quarter of cheese Brom held up to her. "So. Tell me."
