   222	
   223	He did not tell it well. He told it in order, which was the only way he knew.
   224	
   225	Lira ate her bread and watched the river. When he had finished she brushed the crumbs off her tapes, one hand and then the other.
   226	
   227	"Does it have an outside?" she said. "Your corridor."
   228	
   229	"Karis says every door opens one way."
