+- Reader Standard holds. Even the legal concession chapter translates its effect into the shrinking corridor / cleared table image (ch44:71–83). No material unsuitable for thirteen.
+- Padding/texture watch: the closing half of M7 repeatedly stages documents or boxes squared to table/shelf edges, hands on pockets, meaningful silence, and a final understated sentence explaining mutual knowledge (ch44:101–137; ch46:81–169; ch47:117–225). Character motifs justify several instances, but the sheer cross-chapter concentration should be a texture-pass target.
+- No cross-movement continuity or knowledge-boundary defect found in M7.
