+- Office and address locks hold. The side-door log remains *Caelen Hesk-ward* (ch44:19–21), Gault is repeatedly *evaluator of record* (ch44:67–95; ch46:3–35), and the requested certificate is explicitly from the Archmarshal’s office (ch46:253–285; ch47:13).
