+
+- Calendar progression is legible and so far exact: ch10:15 fixes the first sitting on the sixth Fifth-day; ch12:3 puts Lira’s rated trial on day 30; ch12:237 gives the advancement docket on day 31; ch13:91 puts the sitting on day 40. The numeric Fifth-day convention is compliant with the season-blind rule.
+- Lane bill ratifies cleanly in ch11:153–195: Lira ten, Force ten, Blade twelve; clean lines eleven, eleven, thirteen. The explanation lands as a bill rather than a banner or flag.
